{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/1a719c3ff03edce4ed5889c47bd9fd55.poster.avif?t=1756386410\" width=800 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/1a719c3ff03edce4ed5889c47bd9fd55.webm?t=1756386410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/1a719c3ff03edce4ed5889c47bd9fd55.mp4?t=1756386410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design Your Own Cemetery:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and restore a ruined cemetery, then expand it; add services like toilets and guest houses for visitors through cleaning, decoration, and landscaping. Repair old gravestones and add mausoleums and statues to offer elite clients a magnificent space. Gain prestige and become the country\u2019s most elite cemetery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/92c02083c41154bd6e96ac1735035d55.poster.avif?t=1756386410\" width=800 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/92c02083c41154bd6e96ac1735035d55.webm?t=1756386410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/92c02083c41154bd6e96ac1735035d55.mp4?t=1756386410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Prepare Funerals:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take newly deceased individuals to the morgue, wash, and clean them. Organize the memorial service in the church. Apply makeup to make the deceased\u2019s face look lively, and carefully dress them in the finest clothes. These preparations are crucial; help them present themselves for the last time in the most beautiful way possible in front of their loved ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/6b4b15c7fd95ff6175523f0357452037.poster.avif?t=1756386410\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/6b4b15c7fd95ff6175523f0357452037.webm?t=1756386410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/6b4b15c7fd95ff6175523f0357452037.mp4?t=1756386410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Different Burial Methods:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features various religions and burial traditions. The deceased\u2019s family\u2019s wishes regarding burial or cremation must be carried out with precision. Players will discover the challenges and rewards of each method while managing their cemetery. This variety offers different experiences with each playthrough, enhancing the game's replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/461a510f7c4fa0999b8f4f2beeb60d2a.poster.avif?t=1756386410\" width=800 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/461a510f7c4fa0999b8f4f2beeb60d2a.webm?t=1756386410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/461a510f7c4fa0999b8f4f2beeb60d2a.mp4?t=1756386410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Market Organ Trade:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can sell organs and special items obtained from corpses to NPCs who appear only at night. This dark trade negatively affects the player\u2019s reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/eabed5cbf1dc6b83c3de141d2aa9543e.poster.avif?t=1756386410\" width=800 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/eabed5cbf1dc6b83c3de141d2aa9543e.webm?t=1756386410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/extras/eabed5cbf1dc6b83c3de141d2aa9543e.mp4?t=1756386410\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561920?t=1756386410","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/8ac986d6511e8f1533f71b7e1b4c9b0b954ea958/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756386410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/9149e892fc595f507a20a46a3b3a7d97bd18bb90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756386410","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561920/9149e892fc595f507a20a46a3b3a7d97bd18bb90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756386410","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"con